{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0000", "text": "أنصت و شاهد وابقَ هادئاً.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0001", "text": "الاستماع إلى كلامه لم يكن بالأمر الحكيم.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0002", "text": "من السخيف أن تصدقه.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0003", "text": "كلامه وأفعاله لا يتفقان معا.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0004", "text": "كلامه وأعماله متناقضان.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0005", "text": "عاش الاتحاد السوفيتي!", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0006", "text": "يمكنك أن تقرأ هذا الكتاب .", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0007", "text": "بحثت عن مفتاح المنزل في حقيبتها و لكنها لم تجده", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0008", "text": "قال لي قصة حياته .", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0009", "text": "في أمريكا، يتحدث الناس الإنجليزية.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0010", "text": "في الولايات المتحدة، يتحدث الناس بالإنجليزية.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0011", "text": "الناس يحبون التحدث والتحدث والتحدث.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0012", "text": "عاد إلى اليابان.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0013", "text": "ترك الكتاب على الطاولة.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0014", "text": "نظف غرفته يوم الأحد", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0015", "text": "أنا أقرأ كتابًا الآن .", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0016", "text": "لا أستطيع أكل اللحوم.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0017", "text": "لعبت التنس طوال اليوم.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0018", "text": "لم أستطع النوم.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ar-0019", "text": "لقد اشتريت هذا الكتاب من المكتبة التي أمام المحطة.", "lang": "ar", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
